Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.68,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,WHITE RABBIT: Oh\, dear! Oh\, dear! I shall be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:14.19,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: A rabbit wearing a waistcoat and carrying a watch? How curious! Oh wait! Mr. Rabbit! Where are you going? What's the hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:17.26,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,WHITE RABBIT: The Queen will be furious if I don't reach the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:24.20,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: Welcome to Wonderland\, little girl! Looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.15,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: I'm looking for my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:32.58,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: That depends on where you want to go! We're all mad here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:35.33,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Everybody seems so strange here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:38.00,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: Follow the music to the tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:43.50,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Twinkle\, twinkle\, little bat...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.15,0:00:47.51,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MAD HATTER: No room! No room! Welcome to our tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:49.46,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: But there's plenty of room!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.81,0:00:53.57,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MARCH HARE: Have some tea! Or perhaps some imaginary wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.24,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Why is this tea party so strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:59.79,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MAD HATTER: Because in Wonderland\, nothing makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:04.30,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Please stop! I'm trying to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:06.09,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Don't you ever wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:09.32,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Only when someone mentions cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:11.75,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MARCH HARE: Wake up\, Dormouse! It's tea time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:14.34,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Oh! Then I'm wide awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:20.88,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: Who dares enter my garden? Off with their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:22.59,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Why are you so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:25.34,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: How dare you question the Queen of Hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:29.61,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Yes\, Your Majesty! Nobody questions the Queen of Hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:32.52,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Do you always follow orders without thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:35.03,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Well\, I'm a soldier\, not a thinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:38.02,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: Enough talking! Seize her immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:39.89,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Yes\, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:44.24,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: I'm not afraid of you! You're nothing but a pack of cards!